f-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record in Newberry County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same middle ran 47% of normal in November to December and 172% in April to May. Grid 17594 had its driest year in 2007 at 59% of normal.</p>"}
